  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic swamps of Old Brokeland, Sk8r Boi spent his early hatchling days dodging Scrapdragons and scavenging for discarded microchips. The Cryo Scorchshields are a reminder of a close call with a malfunctioning coolant system, but now he uses his sharp Sk8rs to shred through anything, and he's ready to do whatever it takes to get some DRIP.",
    "class": "Scavenger",
    "name": "Sk8r Boi",
    "personality": "Grim but hopeful. Sk8r Boi is haunted by the past, but he maintains a dry sense of humor and a surprising amount of optimism. Despite the wasteland, he trusts that there's a better tomorrow if he and his crew can survive long enough to see it. Loyal to a tee, unless double-crossed.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "With a burst of speed from his Sk8rs, Sk8r Boi dashes through the battlefield, leaving a trail of slippery toxic ooze that slows down enemies and deals minor damage over time. It can be used to get out of trouble, or to set a trap on the battlefield.",
